      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ac57845180a7e323c02d48d|full_name}: Thanks for letting us know. \nSide note, I do hope that the dev team is aware that not communicating that x feature is currently being prioritised over for example the login issues causes these lapses of years worth of unaddressed issues that makes various reports look like they are being ignored. Letting us know what is being currently worked on or investigated, and why, so that time can be filled with some healthy communication would be nice. This way a year of no information becomes bites of visible progress and insight into what the current priority is, which may also include a short term roadmap for desired issues that could be addressed sooner if updates go smoothly, etc.",
